hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2948","Narrated to us Yunus ibn 'Abd al-A'la, he said: Ibn Wahb informed us. And narrated to us al-Fadl ibn Ya'qub al-Jazari, he said: Muhammad (meaning Ibn Ja'far) Ghundar narrated to us, he said: Malik narrated to us, from Ibn Shihab, from 'Urwah, from 'Aishah (RA), that she said:\n\n\We went out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) for the Farewell Pilgrimage. She said: 'Those who had entered ihram for 'Umrah performed tawaf of the House and (sa'i) between as-Safa and al-Marwah"","" then they exited ihram. Then they performed another tawaf (tawaf al-ifadah) after returning from Mina for their Hajj.'\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
